"• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." = "• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings.";
"• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." = "• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security.";
