"1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, Husk downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again." = "1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, Husk downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again.";
