"Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time." = "Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time.";
